      "writtenOn": "2024-07-03T03:41:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why change the access levels here? I agree with the conversion to constexpr, but the access level changes seem unrelated and I don\u0027t see any justification to altering this...",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 91,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 91,
        "endChar": 8
