      "writtenOn": "2024-07-03T19:36:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Before, the enum values and KeyType were both `protected`, which is not public (only subclasses can see them).\n\nNow, the enum values are `private` and the KeyType is `public`. This leaks out KeyType, which was hidden before, and prevents subclasses from seeing a few values which seem reasonable to expose to a subclass.\n\nI think we should leave the access levels the way they were before.",
